  "description": "Kind of a sleepy week, which is a good sign",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Friday everyone! Two weeks ago, we had a euphoric week, with every stock pumping upwards. Short term traders appeared to take profits last week, making it not nearly as enjoyable for mid-term investors. This week…everything seems to have just hovered around. Up one day, down the next. This isn’t exactly exhilarating…but its also not a bad sign. It is good to get consolidations and breaths in the market, for any solid chance of upward momentum again. The VIX scared us a little last Friday, but has since cooled off, sitting at 16.3 which is absolutely still “investable” territory.</p><p>Even though things have been going well for 9+ weeks now, I don’t want anyone to get too comfortable. The revised jobs reports that the Trump Administration publicly posted will cause irreparable damage. I, nor anyone, can prove to you what the <em><strong>real </strong></em>jobs numbers are….One commentor the lie started all the way back to Obama, or maybe even during Bush’s time. Maybe the lie started with Biden. Maybe the lie started with Trump. We frankly do not know. What we do know now, is:</p><ol><li><p>We can no longer trust data coming from the U.S. Government. I truly detest saying this…but…what faith do you have in reports now?</p></li><li><p>Regardless, left or right, every politician now publicly knows they can lie. </p></li><li><p>This deteriorates faith in the U.S. Government, the dollar, and our entire monetary system which obviously influences our markets. </p></li></ol><p>Frankly, even if the numbers had been faked during Biden’s administration, I somewhat wish they had not posted this revision. Trust is forever damaged. I believe we are going to enter into a data reliability crisis…where only the elites have the true data, and us average people are misled a dozen different directions, driven by political narratives. I’m doing my utmost to keep my political opinions out of this. But this is worrisome. </p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YRq2!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YRq2!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YRq2!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YRq2!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YRq2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YRq2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp\" width=\"500\" height=\"362\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/df5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:362,&quot;width&quot;:500,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:23578,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/webp&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/170439114?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YRq2!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YRq2!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YRq2!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!YRq2!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdf5c6f8d-82c5-43d2-9d07-8cc3f62cb7a7_500x362.webp 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">Faith in the jobs report has already been dwindling. The massive revision only bolsters that sentiment. No one knows where the lie started…or if a lie has even occurred. But we do know faith is broken now.</figcaption></figure></div><p>Apologies for the negativity on Friday…but its a discussion to be had, and something we must ponder on. Short term investing remains optimistic, but long term investing looks shaky. </p><p>Regardless of what all the news posts, <strong>PRICE ACTION IS KING </strong>👑. Trend is up, 200 day moving averages remain held…so we <em><strong>maintain a bullish stance</strong></em> until the price action says otherwise. Enjoy it while we can!</p><p>If you missed any of these other posts from this week, be sure to check them out:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/buying-a-stock-quick-update?r=4z8lgl\">A stock that I bought this week…</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/why-hii-is-going-to-win-the-next?r=4z8lgl\">Why Huntington Ingalls, HII, appears bullish</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/position-sizing-and-dca-up?r=4z8lgl\">Position sizing and how to DCA UP…NOT DOWN!</a></p></li></ul><p>I hope you have a great weekend, and if you have questions, feel free to ask me directly in the chat, during market hours. Thanks for stopping by! 👍</p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a></strong></em></p><div class=\"community-chat\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/tjstocks/chat?utm_source=chat_embed&quot;,&quot;subdomain&quot;:&quot;tjstocks&quot;,&quot;pub&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:3537822,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Timothy’s StockTok&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;StockTok 📈&quot;,&quot;author_photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r3SF!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F545d5c5a-3f40-44b0-b1a1-980901ed236d_565x565.png&quot;}}\" data-component-name=\"CommunityChatRenderPlaceholder\"></div>",
